{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act11mini_level_act11mini_st02",
  "groupId": "act11mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "後會有期",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fb93703340797a97f81dd34d9a8ecef4beb6c238e9f31faed5fd630b80545ae5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "大清早的，還有點涼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "尚蜀這天氣，現在嫌涼了，到晌午又熱得很，難伺候啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "寒暑需有個度，想來尚蜀百姓早已適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "說得是。不過瞧著最近雨水多了，怕是天氣要變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "希望不是什麼大寒大暑，給人點時間適應適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "季候到了，總有些變節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "船家，可否載我一程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "您說，去哪兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "渡江。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "沒問題。您看您這江，是怎麼渡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "走哪條道，趕時間不趕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "有什麼不同？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "要是行得急，時間緊，我便行快船，費不了多少工夫就能到對岸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "若我不急又如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "那就得在渡口先整治些酒菜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "酒在船上溫著，船就從上游這渡口，貼著邊漂下去。能看到城市，也能瞧見正在種的田，風景好著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "聽著不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "那就這麼定，我先把酒溫上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "......你倒很會做生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "做這行的，還是要懂得察言觀色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "您這樣的老丈，沒幾個不愛多看看這尚蜀城的。就算不看城，也愛看人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "說的不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "人，確實當看，若不看人，就是白走一遭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "梁洵應當與你說過，他今晚便該隨我回京。出尚蜀這趟路，便由你指引。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "......確實說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "您別怪罪，梁大人這回走得急，我們這些人難免多擔憂些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "我們這知府大人......說是了不得的父母官，可到底還年輕著呢，有時候看著就像家裡的子侄，讓人擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "text": "梁洵他有這般才能，也有志氣。頂得住，便是功成名就。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "要是頂不住呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "——唉，算了，不該問。您要看看這尚蜀，只管跟我來便是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "就是可惜，鯉小子前頭還在找人，我看今天他要見梁大人，是難了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "天還有些涼，好在茶是熱的，倒也不冷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人公務繁忙，今天怎麼來得這麼早？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "說好陪你看戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "多披些衣物，小心風寒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "什麼時候說好了？之前只說，得空了就一起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "今日就得空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "騙人。太傅交代得那麼緊急，工作上的交接就有大堆麻煩......梁大人莫非是昨夜沒睡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "咳，有稍微闔眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐今天也醒得早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "我猜不聽人勸的梁大人今天一早會來，一直在等著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "這，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "茶杯空了，杯子遞給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "一杯茶而已，你我之間還用說謝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "能在這山上坐坐，喝茶醒醒神，也不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "這兒的茶點味道也挺好......油酥，芝麻糕，還有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "糖果子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "上回寧小姐誇獎過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "啊，您就記著了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "嗯。寧小姐喜歡，就多留意了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "尚蜀什麼都好，就是口味上有點重，好在糕點大多還是香軟甜口的，合我的口味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "唉，梁大人府裡煮的鍋子最初也辣得很，之後倒好了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "最初動不了一筷子就要找水，太狼狽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "府裡解辣的湯時刻備著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐的家鄉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "南邊水鄉，不大吃辣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "難為你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "這有什麼，總歸要適應的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "話雖如此，這不是輕易能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "有心想要適應，就不難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "總歸要適應的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人之前提過，您是尚蜀本地人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "梁某人早年離家，近些年才回到故鄉。寧小姐知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "聽你提起過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "這麼說來，你的那位龍門朋友，就是在離家期間遇上的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "那時少不知事，離家闖蕩，交了不少朋友，以為少年意氣無堅不摧，無所不可為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "做了不少貽笑大方的蠢事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "交朋友可不算蠢事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人，你交的是位好朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......是梁某幸運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "要不是這次事出緊急，確實該好好請你那位朋友在尚蜀遊覽一番，盡一盡地主之誼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "還能多聽兩句梁大人的過往趣事，不知道同現在差別大不大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "我從未變過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "或許還是有些變化。不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "梁某人要做的事，為一方百姓......從未變過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "昨夜太傅提出隨他上京......我原本，不想應下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "你怪我替你答應了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "不。不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "那時猶豫已經是不應該，我該謝謝寧小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "你不怪罪我就好了。你放心不下尚蜀，我能理解，其他人也能，但太傅開口是不一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "太傅身邊不留庸才。他老人家給出的，只會是最險、最難搏的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "我想如果我沒看錯梁洵這個人，那你要是一時猶豫拒絕了，之後一定是會後悔的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......我明白。讓寧小姐擔心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "......呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "啊，沒事，沒什麼。我只是忽然想到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "你那時要是當真毫不猶豫地同意要走，恐怕，我也是要有些生氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......咳。寧小姐說笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "我可不是說笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "咳咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "這才多久，日頭就起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人，這戲好看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "尚可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "那要不要早些下山？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......再看一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐，再看一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "好了好了，爹！別看了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "有什麼啊，這有什麼可看的，不就一張行程單嘛，我和其他人都商量好了，等東西收拾好了就出發！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "我還有一屋子的東西沒收拾呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "急什麼，我再看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "你們一群年輕人，決定做得那麼急，容易出事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "年輕人怎麼了？誰還不是從年輕時過來的，爹你年輕時不也天南地北地走鏢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "能一樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "沒人帶著，你們曉得道上哪條路走得，哪條路走不得？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "這時節出這麼趟遠門，你可知該帶什麼，不該帶什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "爹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "時代不同了爹，可別翻您那老黃曆了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "遙夜！聽話，爹能給你說的不多了，這次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "你定了要去玉門城，就去吧。我也攔不住你們，不走我們給鋪的這條路，沒准也是好事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "爹啊，假如說啊，我就打個比方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "假如我們這客棧不開了，您還有幾個叔伯，有沒有考慮過和我們一起去玉門城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "......遙夜啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "哎爹我就隨口說說，我曉得肯定不成的！您就隨便聽聽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "遙夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "這客棧本來就是為你留的，你要是不接手，趁早歇業關門也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "你說要自立門戶，我不攔著，我信你是有考慮的，但我還是得給你說兩句，你也別嫌爹囉嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "爹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "你給年輕人們牽了頭，他們都信你，跟著你，你說時代變了......沒錯，時代是變了，但這事放在什麼時候都變不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "你既然站出來，一呼百應，那往後遇上再難的事，你也不能退，再苦，再累，你得擔著，聽見沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "我......知道的，爹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "......唉。行了，這單子你拿去，有些不那麼好走的路，我給你避開些，能走大道便走大道，那些我們蹚過的泥巴路，你們可別再踩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "您放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "放心，難啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "我現在就有樁心事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "您說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "遙夜，你年紀也不小了，這次去玉門城，能不能正經帶個小夥子回來看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "停，停！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "爹！瞎操什麼心呢！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "怎麼是瞎操心了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "這就是瞎操心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "哎呀，不同爹你說了，我還要去一趟梁大人府裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "你找梁大人作甚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "不是我要找，是那個姓鯉的要找！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "他都找不著，可見梁大人應當不在府裡，你去又有什麼用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......有道理。好啊，這姓鯉的又用這招糊弄我！我現在就去找他算帳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "text": "姑娘家家的，什麼時候才能穩重些哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "別人的家事，不要東張西望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......不用操心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "麟青硯，你現在這是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "吃飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "你知道我不是問這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "你一早就等在這裡，阻攔我去見那三位，總得給我一個理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "我說過，我會同你一起去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "麟青硯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "大呼小叫，像什麼樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "我並非代表大理寺走這一趟，不論官職，你該叫我什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "規矩你是忘了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......小姨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "何必總搬出這一套來壓我？又不是什麼正經的親戚，你也不過是仗著麟家和我爹相交，長我一個輩分......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "天師府這次要你走這一趟，到底為了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "自然是為百姓蒼生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "好一個為百姓蒼生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "既然如此，真就要放任......真就這麼繼續下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "太傅已經做下判斷，我等遵令即可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "倒是你，左樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "你入司歲台時日尚淺，這次尚蜀背後所藏之事不簡單，現在看來，許多內幕你並不知情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "當差卻一知半解，荒唐！誰叫你來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......無人指派，是我主動請纓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "怎麼，你不相信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "我信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "我信你主動請纓，卻也信有人背後作怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......我倒是頭一次聽說，大理寺鐵面無私忠直坦白的麟青硯，也學會揣測這些官場陰私了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "傳聞裡你不是最厭煩理會這類蠅營狗苟，要是有人與你聒噪，就要電他個頂蓋發麻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "如今這樣，可不是你的風格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "我的行事風格，不必你提點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "我被託付關照你，事關你，自然應當謹慎些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "你彈舌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "沒有的事，小姨聽錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "待此間事了，你也該同我回一趟京城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚蟄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "這是左將軍的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "知道了。我隨你回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "禮部左侍郎......其實是個不太參與政務的職位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人有沒有聽說過，我如今這官職是怎麼來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "願聞其詳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人靠自己出人頭地，這是我比不上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "寧家......算是個大姓。祖上蒙蔭，後人也算上進，一輩輩積累些門路財產，就這麼傳下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "我祖父官至一品，勤勤懇懇幾十年，就是我不說名字，梁大人應該也認得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "也就是對著梁大人，我才肯說，不然這話顯得像是我要炫耀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐......很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "我知道你不會這麼想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "之前也和梁大人說過，我在家中同輩的兄弟姐妹裡行七。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "我父親那一輩人志不在此，小輩們也是，我最大的堂兄大我十來歲，早已成家立業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "祖父準備從官場上退下時，正巧我年少氣盛，被捲進一個走私貪污的案子，僥倖抓了一串賊人，轉天公文就被送到祖父案頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐才幹過人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "場面話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "不敢。是真心話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "那我信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "祖父那時候單獨將我喊去書房，我們沒聊什麼特別的，他老人家就問了我一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "他問：“辭秋，你這一身才學本領，可願為國、為民、為天下？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "我就答說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......肝腦塗地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "在所不辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐好氣魄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "好啦，故事就講到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人，茶涼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "還有些溫度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "可我看梁大人你的手已涼了。要是你樂意我將這披風還你一半，我們倒也不是不能再沏上一壺熱茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......身體要緊，披好，別摘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "我沒事，不信你試試......是不是比你梁洵暖和？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "梁某人手冷，別凍著寧小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "今天之後，不知要什麼時候才有機會再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐要多保重身體，不要貪涼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......要是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "要是寧小姐往後還要賞花，不嫌路途遙遠，便不必自己動手，托人帶一封信，交給我來種就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "寧小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "哎，啊，嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "嗯......你既然都這樣說了，那我就也直說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人，你兜裡那紮了緞帶的首飾盒子，還要揣多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......咳，這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "怎麼，梁大人，難不成那還能是你準備要送給旁人的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "頂唔順啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......不該帶你來找人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "不該。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "你不露面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "現在露面，不合適吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "他們這你來我往，簡直比台上的戲還精彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "誰想到這姓梁的......唉，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......不，不行，不能算了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "誰想到這姓梁的，十多年未見，成如今這樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "十多年未見，不稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "難頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "好在還有茶可喝，有戲可看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "這麼一來，梁洵啊，你可是又欠我一筆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "想找老朋友喝最後一杯酒，到底是難囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
